    <briefdescription>
<para>Strategy interface for a distributed, TTL-based lock. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1maintenance_1_1_database_maintenance_orchestrator" kindref="compound">DatabaseMaintenanceOrchestrator</ref> to prevent two cluster nodes from executing the same maintenance schedule concurrently. </para>
